Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['The operating result more than doubled from €330 thousand in Year 1 to €374 thousand in Year 2.', 'On this income statement, distribution costs of €52 thousand are deducted from revenue before gross profit is calculated.', 'Finance costs – net worsened by more than €10 thousand between Year 1 and Year 2 on these figures.', 'Cost of sales of €725 thousand exceeded revenue of €1188 thousand in Year 2.', 'Gross profit as a percentage of revenue was higher in Year 2 than in Year 1 on this income statement where Year 2 revenue was €1188 thousand.'], ARRAY[false, false, false, false, true], ARRAY['FALSE — Operating result moved from 330 to 374.', 'FALSE — Gross profit is revenue minus cost of sales only.', 'FALSE — Finance costs – net changed by 7.', 'FALSE — Cost of sales was 725 against revenue 1188.', 'TRUE — Margins were 38.8% then 39.0%.'], '5/5', 51, 'full' ),
